30
00:01:48,005 --> 00:01:51,074
it is microwaves that arrive.

31
00:01:51,074 --> 00:01:55,212
And they are the famous cosmic microwave background.

32
00:01:55,212 --> 00:01:58,415
Now because every direction in which you look

33
00:01:58,415 --> 00:02:00,884
ends back in the young universe,

34
00:02:00,884 --> 00:02:05,422
then the microwave radiation comes to us from all directions,

35
00:02:05,422 --> 00:02:06,623
and for many years,

36
00:02:06,623 --> 00:02:09,826
